  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c15c550dae6be8805f9d3d4bfd03af1baad3e8b731d0bc8a63da99c3107ba0c2",
      "text": "Sun Wukong’s\nNoisy Nap",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "18d658e79094c8a5cd0c9526c142758b2bf1c37d3a4905f61d2231f1fc59e4c7",
      "text": "Sun Wukong yawned.\n“Time for a nap!”\nHe found a shady peach tree.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "79c84d2adc8e2352eda929f2bc073008b44a46c92727cdaa06d5f613bb173d53",
      "text": "Pigsy brought a pillow.\n“Soft as a cloud!”\nThen his tummy went\nRUMBLE.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2b4d1f89b8dfbfb3db799c96c03308d0e834199a843889dd8c9a924f00eb51ad",
      "text": "“A snack first,” said Wukong.\nMunch, munch.\nPigsy’s tummy grew quiet.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "898e5cbad29d90c6f0b925c8e24ecb1a914c3ed984f7064e21c079200328a18f",
      "text": "Sandy waved a leaf fan.\nA leaf tickled Wukong’s nose.\n“Ah… ah… ACHOO!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2aa4042ad5f0b6396be01dbe5694721d293ac52d763454ae5cea044c308c4139",
      "text": "A little bird sang a song.\n“TWEET! TWEET!”\nWukong sat up.\n“A little softer, please!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6df687c128c9b6af25e9bdb584ff98b9653f2102e4b0b9b6307d368b77413b28",
      "text": "Pigsy chewed softly.\nSandy fanned slowly.\nThe bird sang, “Twee…\ntwee…”\nWukong smiled.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "04a47fac27fe23605ac321b73db35116099312c885ed4d5709e4f3171a35e95a",
      "text": "Wukong blew one tiny puff.\nA little cloud curled around\nhis feet.\n“Just right,” he whispered.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5355cf6c0c6ee648ebe2079bf28c19e774b1e0d103f64fc9a31a11932c2e1a9",
      "text": "Soon, his friends were sleepy\ntoo.\nPigsy snored. “Snrrr…”\nWukong gave one last giggle.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6b245c9c0a04e4d17b5be550d80800deecec57b0391dbf246d1e57fe8c6355aa",
      "text": "Under the peach tree,\neveryone slept.\nThe leaves went hush.\nThe clouds drifted by.\nEven heroes need a nap.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
